  "text": "Your evening theatre look is anchored by a sophisticated burgundy double-breasted coat that adds instant warmth and elegance for the autumn night. Beneath it, you wear a soft milky shirt paired with a structured grey skirt to maintain a neat silhouette without losing comfort for the performance. The ensemble is completed with your classic graphite loafers, which offer the perfect balance of polish and ease for an evening out in the city.",
