  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#663·27",
      "text": "This is a classic double-breasted coat in a deep burgundy shade. The structured cut provides a polished outer layer that suits the evening occasion perfectly, offering both warmth and a touch of drama for your theatre visit."
