    {
      "n": "#354·41",
      "text": "A lightweight milky shirt serves as your inner layer here. Its soft, neutral tone prevents the burgundy coat from feeling overwhelming, creating a gentle transition to the darker outerwear while maintaining a fresh appearance."
    },
    {
      "n": "#392·42",
      "text": "This is a khaki belt designed to add definition if needed. While your coat is double-breasted and already structured, you can wear this at your waist to cinch the fit slightly if you desire a more tailored silhouette under the open coat."
