    {
      "n": "#708·25",
      "text": "A small beige kerchief adds a whisper of texture and warmth around your neck. Its light color harmonizes with your milky shirt, preventing any visual heaviness near your face while providing an extra layer against the autumn chill."
    },
    {
      "n": "#40·15",
      "text": "Your loafers are finished in a sleek graphite shade with a subtle shine. This dark neutral grounds the outfit, allowing the burgundy coat and milky shirt to stand out while ensuring your feet remain comfortable for the evening."
